Statement of changes (Apache-2.0 Section 4b)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

DreamCodeVR+ modifies and extends the original work as follows:

  * Replaces the original Node.js "Ubiq-Genie" backend with a new Rust workspace
    (`crates/`, `apps/`) that joins the same Ubiq room as a service peer.
  * Adds a fail-closed action-plan validator and a bounded action-plan IR
    (Mode C) that runs without runtime code compilation.
  * Adds static/lexical + optional .NET Roslyn validation of generated C#
    (Mode B) and a Docker/gVisor sandbox harness for untrusted code (Mode D).
  * Adds a two-layer intent screen, observability, an admin/debug panel,
    personalization/RAG, and a reproducible red-team harness.
  * Adds authored Unity C# integration scripts under `unity/` and
    `unity-examples/`.
  * The original runtime-C# path is retained as Mode A, now gated by the
    validator, and is OFF by default.

